    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Max et Lou vont se marier. Ils n\u2019ont qu\u2019une seule condition : ce sera un tout petit petit mariage. Pas de famille, pas d\u2019amis, pas de bouquet ou de pi\u00e8ce mont\u00e9e, ni m\u00eame de discours niais ou de danses d\u00e9biles ! Juste eux et leurs t\u00e9moins. Mais \u00e7a, c\u2019est sans compter sur l\u2019ENORME f\u00eate surprise qui s\u2019organise ! Ils devaient \u00eatre 4, ils se retrouvent 300. Ils avaient dit \u00ab tout petit petit \u00bb, ils auront grand, tr\u00e8s tr\u00e8s grand !",
        "english": "Lou and Max, a happy young couple, want to adopt a baby so bad that they\u2019ve done everything they know to create a picture-perfect profile. They\u2019ve lied about their income, families and living situation. Now all that\u2019s left is to get married \u2013 in the simplest, sweetest, smallest wedding possible. But their zany best man and bridesmaid have other plans in store. Gradually the intimate little ceremony turns into a huge and unconventional wedding bash! Family, friends and even the adoption agent show up to take part in an explosion of utterly incredible situations. Can they get away with their lies and save their wedding?"
    },
